+ *   c[8..11]   four directional lights' directions in eye space, c[12..15] their colours
+ *   c[16]      x, y: texture coordinate scale; z: 0; w: 1
+ *   c[17..94]  26 bones, three rows each
+ *   c[95]      x: what the eye depth is multiplied by for the fog coordinate (see gliSkinDraw) */
